seNotes":{"version":"3.9.2","title":"Release v3.9.2","markdown":"## 新功能\n- 新增 GLM 5.3 Flash 多模态模型，订阅用户开箱即用。\n- Computer Use 体验优化，配合 GLM 5.3 Flash 识别更准、操作更稳。\n- 使用电脑控制功能前会明确提示所需权限。\n- 电脑控制功能支持 macOS Intel 芯片机型使用。\n- 浏览器操作时会优先复用已有标签页。\n\n## 问题修复\n- 修复浏览器操作时标签页偶发冻结或无法恢复的问题。\n- 修复插件名称显示错误，现与插件市场保持一致。\n- 修复 macOS 下电脑控制操作偶发失效的问题。","releaseDate":"2026-08-26T11:23:50.116Z","releaseNotesByLocale":{"zh-CN":{"title":"Release v3.9.2","markdown":"## 新功能\n- 新增 GLM 5.3 Flash 多模态模型，订阅用户开箱即用。\n- Computer Use 体验优化，配合 GLM 5.3 Flash 识别更准、操作更稳。\n- 使用电脑控制功能前会明确提示所需权限。\n- 电脑控制功能支持 macOS Intel 芯片机型使用。\n- 浏览器操作时会优先复用已有标签页。\n\n## 问题修复\n- 修复浏览器操作时标签页偶发冻结或无法恢复的问题。\n- 修复插件名称显示错误，现与插件市场保持一致。\n- 修复 macOS 下电脑控制操作偶发失效的问题。"},"en-US":{"title":"Release v3.9.2","markdown":"## New Features\n- Added the GLM 5.3 Flash multimodal model, available out of the box for subscription users.\n- Improved the Computer Use experience, with more accurate recognition and more stable operations when paired with GLM 5.3 Flash.\n- Required permissions are now clearly prompted before using the computer control feature.\n- The computer control feature is now supported on macOS models with Intel chips.\n- Browser operations now preferentially reuse existing tabs.\n\n## Bug Fixes\n- Fixed an issue where tabs would occasionally freeze or fail to restore during browser operations.\n- Fixed incorrect plugin name display; names are now consistent with the plugin marketplace.\n- Fixed an issue where computer control operations would occasionally stop working on macOS."}}},"receivePreviewUpdates":false,"autoDownloadAndInstallUpdates":true,"skippedElectronUpdateVersions":{},"settingsSyncFirstRunPromptHandled":true,"webRemoteControlExternalRelayDevice":{"deviceSid":"d_CSTgNkx2vnS52qfVJSdQW7"},"webRemoteControlLastEnabledContext":{"workspacePath":"C:\\Users\\llh04\\.zcode\\workspace\\default","initialTaskId":"sess_28f28821-3f65-4141-a351-db6f8d46f33e"}}
