, with more complete records and expanded by default\n- MCP servers now support configuring the protocol version, with guidance prompts when negotiation fails\n- Edited messages can now be sent immediately without waiting in the queue\n- View an execution summary and duration when a conversation turn ends\n- The \"Browser\" menu in Settings has been renamed to \"Browser Control\"\n\n## Bug Fixes\n\n- Improved the login authorization flow and fixed occasional callback failures\n- Fixed an intermittent mcp oauth failure\n- Model responses that occasionally cut off or come back blank now retry automatically\n- Fixed an issue where queued messages were lost after an error and interrupted task statuses were displayed incorrectly\n- Unified tool execution status wording; thinking process labels are now more concise and clearer\n- Fixed issues where task action hints were clipped and task information was jumbled on touchscreens\n- Unread markers are now cleared immediately after opening the task timeline\n- Raised the threshold for converting pasted long text into attachments, reducing unintended conversions\n- Fixed an issue where a single tilde was incorrectly displayed as strikethrough\n- The input box no longer loses focus when switching sidebars\n- Input box references and command menus are displayed more clearly, and search no longer retries repeatedly\n- Fixed an issue where multiple skill directories in a workspace could not be listed at the same time\n- Fixed issues where some plugin skills were not recognized and their names displayed inconsistently\n- Usage statistics now show the last seven days by default, with clearer charts and value labels\n- Fixed an issue where background processes remained after exiting on Windows\n- Fixed several issues with Computer Use on macOS and in remote workspaces\n- Improved browser control session stability; page script execution now behaves as expected\n- Fixed an issue where the remote interface menu overflowed the screen on mobile\n- Fixed an issue where model status displayed incorrectly after a plan expired\n- Fixed an error when modifying model configuration while a task is running"}}},"receivePreviewUpdates":false,"autoDownloadAndInstallUpdates":true,"skippedElectronUpdateVersions":{},"settingsSyncFirstRunPromptHandled":true,"webRemoteControlExternalRelayDevice":{"deviceSid":"d_CSTgNkx2vnS52qfVJSdQW7"},"webRemoteControlLastEnabledContext":{"workspacePath":"C:\\Users\\llh04\\.zcode\\workspace\\default","initialTaskId":"sess_28f28821-3f65-4141-a351-db6f8d46f33e"}}
