自己的 API Key；\\n• 用于个人学习、开发测试及经授权的商业项目。\\n\\n二、禁止的行为\\n\\n禁止以下行为，包括但不限于：\\n\\n• 分享、出租、出售、转让 API Key；\\n• 恶意刷接口、压力测试、攻击平台；\\n• 绕过平台限制或安全策略；\\n• 利用平台进行诈骗、赌博、色情、病毒、木马、钓鱼等违法活动；\\n• 利用 API 生成违法、有害或侵犯他人权益的内容；\\n• 违反 OpenAI 或其他上游服务商使用政策；\\n• 影响平台正常运行的其他行为。\\n\\n三、违规处理\\n\\n如发现上述违规行为，平台有权：\\n\\n• 暂停或终止服务；\\n• 冻结 API Key；\\n• 封禁账号；\\n• 不予退款；\\n• 必要时配合有关部门调查。\\n\\n因用户违规导致上游服务账号、API 或平台资源受到限制、封禁或产生损失的，由用户自行承担全部责任，平台不承担任何赔偿责任。\\n平台实行零容忍违规政策。任何违反 OpenAI 或其他上游服务商使用规范、危害平台安全、恶意消耗资源或影响其他用户正常使用的行为，一经发现将立即封禁账号及 API Key，相关损失由用户自行承担，平台不提供解封、退款或赔偿。\"},{\"id\":\"supported-regions\",\"title\":\"支持的国家和地区\",\"content_md\":\"本平台面向全球用户提供服务。\\n\\n但受法律法规、支付渠道及上游服务商政策影响，以下地区可能无法提供服务：\\n\\n• 国际制裁地区；\\n• OpenAI 官方限制服务的地区；\\n• 法律法规禁止提供相关服务的国家或地区。\\n\\n平台有权根据实际情况随时调整支持范围，无需另行通知。\"},{\"id\":\"service-specific-terms\",\"title\":\"服务特定条款\",\"content_md\":\"一、本平台为第三方 API 服务平台，并非 OpenAI 官方，不代表 OpenAI。\\n\\n二、平台提供兼容 OpenAI API 的接入服务，实际模型、价格、上下文长度及可用性可能因上游服务商调整而发生变化，平台有权同步调整。\\n\\n三、平台采用余额计费模式，充值成功后即可使用平台服务。\\n\\n四、充值成功后原则上不支持退款，请确认需求后再进行充值。\\n\\n五、用户可以自行创建、删除和管理 API Key，但不得公开分享、出租、出售或转让。\\n\\n六、未经平台书面授权，不得将本平台服务用于商业转售、代理销售或二次分发。\\n\\n七、如 OpenAI 或其他上游服务商发生维护、限流、升级、模型调整、网络异常或其他不可控情况导致服务中断，本平台不承担赔偿责任。\\n\\n八、用户必须遵守 OpenAI 及其他上游服务商的使用政策。因用户违规导致账号、API Key 或上游资源被限制、暂停或封禁的，平台有权立即终止服务，且不予退款。\\n\\n九、平台保留根据业务需要调整服务内容、计费方式、风控策略及相关规则的权利。\"}],\"turnstile_enabled\":false,\"turnstile_site_key\":\"0x4AAAAAADysLfypv3oqnV3e\",\"tencent_captcha_enabled\":true,\"tencent_captcha_app_id\":\"192918355\",\"tencent_captcha_region\":\"cn\",\"aliyun_captcha_enabled\":false,\"aliyun_captcha_scene_id\":\"\",\"aliyun_captcha_prefix\":\"\",\"aliyun_captcha_region\":\"cn\",\"site_name\":\"CC API\",\"site_logo\":\"data:image/png;base64,\",\"site_subtitle\":\"绝无任何掺水的满血中转站\",\"api_base_url\":\"https://api.xiebc.cc\",\"contact_info\":\"QQ 2574182172\",\"doc_url\":\"\",\"home_content\":\"\\u003cdiv id=\\\"ccapi-home-root\\\" lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\"\\u003e\\n  \\u003cstyle\\u003e\\n    #ccapi-home-root {\\n      --ccapi-bg: #05070d;\\n      --ccapi-bg-secondary: #080c16;\\n      --ccapi-surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);\\n      --ccapi-surface-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.085);\\n      --ccapi-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\\n      --ccapi-border-active: rgba(93, 159, 255, 0.42);\\n      --ccapi-text: #f7f9ff;\\n      --ccapi-text-secondary: #a5aec0;\\n      --ccapi-text-muted: #747f96;\\n      --ccapi-blue: #5b8cff;\\n      --ccapi-cyan: #38d7ff;\\n      --ccapi-purple: #9b7cff;\\n      --ccapi-green: #42dda1;\\n      --ccapi-line: rgba(135, 166, 222, 0.15);\\n      --ccapi-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);\\n      position: relative;\\n      width: 100%;\\n      max-width: 100%;\\n      min-height: 100vh;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      isolation: isolate;\\n      color: var(--ccapi-text);\\n      background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 78% 8%, rgba(91, 140, 255, 0.11), transparent 29rem),\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 16% 30%, rgba(56, 215, 255, 0.075), transparent 25rem),\\n        linear-gradient(180deg, #05070d 0%, #060913 48%, #05070d 100%);\\n      font-family: \\\"Segoe UI\\\", \\\"Microsoft YaHei UI\\\", \\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\", \\\"PingFang SC\\\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\\n      color-scheme: dark;\\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\\n      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root,\\n    #ccapi-home-root * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-sr-only {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      width: 1px;\\n      height: 1px;\\n      padding: 0;\\n      margin: -1px;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\\n      white-space: nowrap;\\n      border: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-shell {\\n      position: relative;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n      width: min(100%, 1240px);\\n      margin: 0 auto;\\n      padding-inline: clamp(18px, 4vw, 42px);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-hero {\\n      position: relative;\\n      min-height: min(920px, 100vh);\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.065);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-particle-canvas {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: 0;\\n      z-index: 0;\\n      width: 100%;\\n      height: 100%;\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      opacity: 0.78;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-hero-grid {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: 0;\\n      z-index: 0;\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      opacity: 0.62;\\n      background-image:\\n        linear-gradient(rgba(132, 168, 231, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px),\\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(132, 168, 231, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px);\\n      background-size: 72px 72px;\\n      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), transparent 92%);\\n      -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), transparent 92%);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-hero-grid::after {\\n      content: \\\"\\\";\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: 0;\\n      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 8%, rgba(5, 7, 13, 0.42) 72%, rgba(5, 7, 13, 0.92) 100%);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-hero-glow {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      z-index: 0;\\n      width: clamp(260px, 42vw, 680px);\\n      aspect-ratio: 1;\\n      border-radius: 50%;\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      filter: blur(24px);\\n      opacity: 0.24;\\n      animation: ccapi-home-glow 16s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-hero-glow--one {\\n      top: -28%;\\n      right: -9%;\\n      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(56, 215, 255, 0.34), rgba(91, 140, 255, 0.16) 40%, transparent 70%);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-hero-glow--two {\\n      bottom: -38%;\\n      left: -14%;\\n      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(91, 140, 255, 0.28), rgba(155, 124, 255, 0.12) 42%, transparent 70%);\\n      animation-delay: -7s;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-static-particles {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: 0;\\n      z-index: 0;\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      opacity: 0.52;\\n      background-image:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 7% 18%, rgba(56, 215, 255, 0.75) 0 1px, transparent 1.8px),\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 92% 13%, rgba(91, 140, 255, 0.7) 0 1px, transparent 1.7px),\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 83% 72%, rgba(155, 124, 255, 0.65) 0 1px, transparent 1.7px),\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 78%, rgba(56, 215, 255, 0.55) 0 1px, transparent 1.6px),\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 48% 9%, rgba(91, 140, 255, 0.56) 0 1px, transparent 1.6px),\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 61% 88%, rgba(56, 215, 255, 0.52) 0 1px, transparent 1.5px);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-hero-inner {\\n      position: relative;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(360px, 0.92fr);\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);\\n      width: 100%;\\n      padding-block: clamp(78px, 10vw, 132px);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-hero-copy {\\n      min-width: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-badge {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 9px;\\n      min-height: 34px;\\n      padding: 7px 13px;\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(116, 169, 255, 0.18);\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      color: #c8d4e9;\\n      background: rgba(10, 15, 27, 0.72);\\n      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      font-weight: 650;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.14em;\\n      animation: ccapi-home-fade-up 0.7s 0.05s both;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-status-dot {\\n      position: relative;\\n      width: 8px;\\n      height: 8px;\\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\\n      border-radius: 50%;\\n      background: var(--ccapi-green);\\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(66, 221, 161, 0.11);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-status-dot::after {\\n      content: \\\"\\\";\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: -4px;\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(66, 221, 161, 0.35);\\n      border-radius: inherit;\\n      animation: ccapi-home-pulse 2.6s ease-out infinite;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-title {\\n      margin: 25px 0 0;\\n      max-width: 760px;\\n      color: var(--ccapi-text);\\n      font-size: clamp(64px, 8vw, 118px);\\n      font-weight: 820;\\n      line-height: 0.89;\\n      letter-spacing: -0.075em;\\n      white-space: nowrap;\\n      animation: ccapi-home-fade-up 0.78s 0.12s both;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-title-accent {\\n      display: inline-block;\\n      padding-right: 0.08em;\\n      color: transparent;\\n      background: linear-gradient(105deg, #6e9bff 4%, #48dfff 58%, #80f2d3 112%);\\n      background-clip: text;\\n      -webkit-background-clip: text;\\n      text-shadow: 0 10px 44px rgba(56, 215, 255, 0.11);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-subtitle {\\n      margin: 27px 0 0;\\n      color: #dce5f5;\\n      font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 29px);\\n      font-weight: 640;\\n      line-height: 1.35;\\n      letter-spacing: -0.03em;\\n      animation: ccapi-home-fade-up 0.78s 0.2s both;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-description {\\n      max-width: 650px;\\n      margin: 17px 0 0;\\n      color: var(--ccapi-text-secondary);\\n      font-size: clamp(15px, 1.25vw, 17px);\\n      line-height: 1.82;\\n      animation: ccapi-home-fade-up 0.78s 0.27s both;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-api-compact {\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 13px;\\n      width: min(100%, 630px);\\n      margin-top: 29px;\\n      padding: 12px 12px 12px 15px;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(131, 170, 239, 0.16);\\n      border-radius: 16px;\\n      background:\\n        linear-gradient(125deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.065), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025)),\\n        rgba(7, 11, 20, 0.72);\\n      box-shadow:\\n        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05),\\n        0 18px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);\\n      animation: ccapi-home-fade-up 0.78s 0.34s both;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-api-icon {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      width: 38px;\\n      height: 38px;\\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(93, 159, 255, 0.2);\\n      border-radius: 11px;\\n      color: #8eb8ff;\\n      background: rgba(91, 140, 255, 0.09);\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-icon-svg {\\n      width: 19px;\\n      height: 19px;\\n      fill: none;\\n      stroke: currentColor;\\n      stroke-width: 1.7;\\n      stroke-linecap: round;\\n      stroke-linejoin: round;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-api-content {\\n      min-width: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-api-label {\\n      display: block;\\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\\n      color: var(--ccapi-text-muted);\\n      font-size: 10px;\\n      font-weight: 750;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.16em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-api-code {\\n      display: block;\\n      max-width: 100%;\\n      color: #eaf2ff;\\n      font-family: Consolas, \\\"SFMono-Regular\\\", \\\"Cascadia Code\\\", \\\"Liberation Mono\\\", monospace;\\n      font-size: clamp(13px, 1.25vw, 15px);\\n      font-weight: 560;\\n      line-height: 1.5;\\n      overflow-wrap: anywhere;\\n      user-select: all;\\n    }\\n\\n    #ccapi-home-root .ccapi-home-copy-button {\\n      position: relative;\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      gap: 8px;\\n      min-height: 44px;\\n      padding: 0 14px;\\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\\n      border: 